##) SYNOPSIS:
==nmvn== **\<command-options\>**
manage local maven configurations and multi-project versions

==nmvn== [**--version** <MVN_VERSION>] [{{args...}}]
==nmvn== **version scan**    [**--config** <FILE>] [**-j**|**--json**]
==nmvn== **version bump**    [**--config** <FILE>] [**--dry-run**|**--apply**] [**--cascade-references-only**|**--cascade-versions**] [**-a** <GA=VER>]...
==nmvn== **version release** [**--config** <FILE>] [**--dry-run**|**--apply**] [**--strict**] [**-a** <GA=VER>]...
==nmvn== **version check**   [**--config** <FILE>] [**--fail-on-warning**] [**-j**|**--json**]

##) EXAMPLES:

```sh nmvn clean install```
   maven clean install

```sh nmvn version scan```
   scan and print multi-project dependency graph

```sh nmvn version check```
   audit workspace for version discrepancies, mixed snapshot/releases, and cycles

```sh nmvn version bump --artifact com.example:my-lib=1.1.0-SNAPSHOT --dry-run```
   dry-run bump artifact and cascade references

```sh nmvn version release --apply --strict```
   resolve all snapshot versions to release and apply changes
